Noto Emoji images

The SVGs in this directory are Google's Noto Color Emoji images, taken
unmodified from https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji, directory
2D/svg/, at commit 99701e07d3d1fe1bdbcdb14964547f0fd592966f (2026-10-26):

  emoji_u1f950.svg  🥐 croissant
  emoji_u1f370.svg  🍰 shortcake
  emoji_u1f96f.svg  🥯 bagel
  emoji_u2615.svg   ☕ hot beverage
  emoji_u1f375.svg  🍵 teacup without handle

